    <fields>
        <fullName>CPT_Objective_Grading__c</fullName>
        <defaultValue>&quot;SALESOKR_GRADING_NOTGRADED&quot;</defaultValue>
        <description>To ensure Varicent ICM identifies the new data as ungraded objectives, all records received from the Quota Setup Tool (QST) for the &quot;cfgSalesOKR&quot; table must include the new ObjectiveGrading value &quot;SALESOKR_GRADING_NOTGRADED&quot;.</description>
